.el .ds Aq '
.TH imify-browse 1 "" "imify" ""
.SH NAME
imify\-browse \- Open the platform in the web browser
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBimify browse\fR [\fB\-\-json\fR] [\fB\-\-no\-browser\fR] [\fB\-q\fR|\fB\-\-quiet\fR] [\fB\-v\fR|\fB\-\-verbose\fR]... [\fB\-\-yes\fR] [\fB\-\-no\-color\fR] [\fB\-\-api\-url\fR] [\fB\-\-profile\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Open the platform in the web browser.
.PP
Opens the API host with the system\*(Aqs default browser: https://platform.imify.ai, unless \-\-api\-url, IMIFY_API_URL, the config file or a profile selects another. Needs no token and sends no request.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-json\fR
Write JSON instead of text [env: IMIFY_OUTPUT=json]
.TP
\fB\-\-no\-browser\fR
Print the URL instead of opening a browser
.TP
\fB\-q\fR, \fB\-\-quiet\fR
Write the result only
.TP
\fB\-v\fR, \fB\-\-verbose\fR
Log more detail to stderr: \-v for debug, \-vv for trace
.TP
\fB\-\-yes\fR
Confirm without prompting
.TP
\fB\-\-no\-color\fR
Disable color [env: NO_COLOR]
.TP
\fB\-\-api\-url\fR \fI<URL>\fR
API host [env: IMIFY_API_URL] [default: profile, then https://platform.imify.ai]
.TP
\fB\-\-profile\fR \fI<NAME>\fR
Settings profile in the config file [env: IMIFY_PROFILE] [default: default]
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help (see a summary with \*(Aq\-h\*(Aq)
.SH EXTRA
Examples:
  imify browse
  imify browse \-\-no\-browser
  imify browse \-\-profile staging
